# 🔥 Heaps (Part 1) - Heap Fundamentals

## 📌 Introduction

A **Heap** is a specialized tree-based data structure that satisfies the **Heap Property**.

A Heap is commonly implemented using a **Complete Binary Tree**.

Heaps are widely used in:

- Priority Queues
- Heap Sort
- Kth Largest / Smallest problems
- Top K problems
- Scheduling
- Graph Algorithms
- Finding minimum / maximum efficiently

