# 1️⃣8️⃣ Heapify

**Heapify** means restoring the heap property.

There are two major operations:

```text
Heapify Up
Heapify Down
```

---

## Heapify Up

Used mainly after:

```text
Insertion
```

Direction:

```text
Bottom → Top
```

---

## Heapify Down

Used mainly after:

```text
Deletion
```

Direction:

```text
Top → Bottom
```

---

# 1️⃣9️⃣ Heapify Comparison

| Operation | Direction | Common Use |
|-----------|-----------|------------|
| Heapify Up | Bottom → Top | Insert |
| Heapify Down | Top → Bottom | Delete |

