# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Assuming a Heap is completely sorted.

❌ Confusing Heap with BST.

❌ Using the wrong child during Min Heapify.

❌ Forgetting to compare both children.

❌ Using a Max Heap when a Min Heap is required.

❌ Forgetting that C++ `priority_queue` is a Max Heap by default.

